              "name": "What happens if a check fails?",
              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "text": "The page stays a draft and the reason is written on the change, in words a person can act on. Nothing half finished is left on the site.",
                "@type": "Answer"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "How is a page taken down again?",
              "@type": "Question",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "text": "The rollback hides the page from the site. It is not deleted from the content system, so it can be brought back.",
